{
  "_comment": [
    "The support cards the web UI offers for borrowing. Matching is done on `title`, ",
    "which is the bracketed line the Borrow Card list prints for each friend; `image` ",
    "is only what the picker shows the user and is never matched against the screen. ",
    "Generated by devtools/scrape_support_cards.py from uma.guide (SSR and SR, released ",
    "on Global); rerun it with --images when new cards come out. Hand-added entries and ",
    "title corrections survive a rerun -- see TITLE_OVERRIDES in that script. ",
    "An entry with no image still works; the picker shows a placeholder.",
    "`character` is the line under the title. It is used as a tiebreak for titles too ",
    "short to identify a card on their own -- see SHORT_TITLE_CHARS in ",
    "core/independent_borrow.py -- and is otherwise informational. `id`, `rarity` and ",
    "`type` are shown in the picker only."
  ],
